## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical memory management under contention: implementing on-demand compression for anonymous memory and integrating it with eviction, without breaking correctness.

## Key Concepts

- Per-page metadata and state transitions
- Lock-free CAS-based synchronization
- Eviction policy using page density scores
- Fault path: decompress on read, decompress-before-use
- Test methodologies for correctness and throughput

## Code Example

